01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Meek's Cutoff is a 2010 American Western historical survival film directed by Kelly Reichardt and starring Michelle Williams,
Bruce Greenwood, Paul Dano, Zoe Kazan, Will Patton, Shirley Henderson, Neal Huff, Tommy Nelson, and Rod Rondeaux.

11
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
The story is loosely based on a historical incident on the Oregon Trail in 1845, in which frontier guide Stephen Meek led a wagon train on an
ill-fated journey through the Oregon High Desert along the route later known as the Meek Cutoff in the western United States.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film was shown in competition at the 67th
Venice International Film Festival.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
The film is formatted in the Academy ratio (1.37:1), a
standard used in many classic Westerns.

14
